flowchart TD
    Blueprint[ForPrint System Blueprint<br/>Architecture, standards and module guidance]

    ProjectInspector[ForPrint Project Inspector<br/>Architecture compliance inspection]
    RuntimeInspector[Production Runtime Inspector<br/>Runtime health and availability]

    Gateway[ForPrint Integration Gateway<br/>Validation, routing, idempotency and delivery ledger]

    CRM[ForPrint CRM<br/>Operator UI, workflow views and coordination]

    OperationalRegistry[ForPrint Operational Registry<br/>Canonical operational truth<br/>clients / requests / orders / tasks]
    Accounting[Accounting Registry Service<br/>Accounting truth<br/>invoices / payments / 1C staging]

    Library[ForPrint Library<br/>Semantic and catalog truth<br/>materials / products / templates / capabilities]

    Calculator[Calculator Engine<br/>Calculation packages, quote drafts and order drafts]
    Prepress[ForPrint Prepress Hub<br/>File analysis, preparation and print-ready artifacts]
    Warehouse[Warehouse Service<br/>Stock, inventory movement and reservations]
    Logistics[Logistics Service<br/>Delivery requests, labels and statuses]
    Backup[Cloud Backup Manager<br/>Backup and restore support]

    Telegram[Telegram Bot<br/>Customer channel]
    Website[Website<br/>Customer channel]
    Mobile[Mobile App<br/>Future customer channel]

    Blueprint -->|module guides / standards / policies| ProjectInspector
    Blueprint -->|module guides| Gateway
    Blueprint -->|module guides| CRM
    Blueprint -->|module guides| OperationalRegistry
    Blueprint -->|module guides| Accounting
    Blueprint -->|module guides| Library
    Blueprint -->|module guides| Calculator
    Blueprint -->|module guides| Prepress
    Blueprint -->|future module guides| Warehouse
    Blueprint -->|future module guides| Logistics
    Blueprint -. deferred until readiness .-> Mobile

    ProjectInspector -->|architecture drift reports| CRM
    RuntimeInspector -->|runtime health reports| CRM

    Telegram -->|customer request envelope| Gateway
    Website -->|web request envelope| Gateway
    Mobile -. future request envelope .-> Gateway
    CRM -->|business command envelope| Gateway

    Gateway -->|validated calculation request| Calculator
    Calculator -->|calculation result / quote draft| Gateway

    Gateway -->|operational command| OperationalRegistry
    OperationalRegistry -->|operational status / read model| Gateway

    Gateway -->|invoice or payment-status request| Accounting
    Accounting -->|accounting status / invoice result| Gateway

    Gateway -->|prepress request| Prepress
    Prepress -->|prepress report / file status| Gateway

    Gateway -->|reservation request| Warehouse
    Warehouse -->|stock / reservation status| Gateway

    Gateway -->|delivery request| Logistics
    Logistics -->|delivery status| Gateway

    Gateway -->|status / result / manual review signal| CRM

    Library -->|catalog references / contracts| Calculator
    Library -->|technical cards / capabilities| Prepress
    Library -->|material catalog references| Warehouse

    OperationalRegistry -->|client / order / task truth views| CRM
    Accounting -->|invoice / payment truth views| CRM

    Backup -. infrastructure support .-> OperationalRegistry
    Backup -. infrastructure support .-> Accounting
    Backup -. infrastructure support .-> Library
    Backup -. infrastructure support .-> Gateway
